<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Pedido Exitoso</title>
  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
    }

    body {
      background-color: #f4f6f9;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: 100vh;
      padding: 20px;
    }

    .card-exito {
      background: #ffffff;
      padding: 40px 30px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      text-align: center;
      max-width: 400px;
      width: 100%;
    }

    .icono-contenedor {
      width: 80px;
      height: 80px;
      background-color: #e6f4ea;
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      margin: 0 auto 20px auto;
    }

    .icono-check {
      width: 40px;
      height: 40px;
      stroke: #28a745;
      stroke-width: 2.5;
      fill: none;
      stroke-linecap: round;
      stroke-linejoin: round;
    }

    .titulo {
      color: #1e293b;
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .descripcion {
      color: #64748b;
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.5;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .btn-volver {
      display: inline-block;
      width: 100%;
      padding: 14px 20px;
      background-color: #28a745;
      color: #ffffff;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 16px;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 8px;
      transition: background-color 0.2s ease;
    }

    .btn-volver:hover {
      background-color: #218838;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="card-exito">
    <div class="icono-contenedor">
      <svg class="icono-check" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
        <path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path>
        <polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline>
      </svg>
    </div>

    <h2 class="titulo">¡Pedido Guardado!</h2>
    <p class="descripcion">
      El pedido se registró correctamente y ha sido enviado a comanda.
    </p>

    <a href="/mesero/principal" class="btn-volver">Volver al Inicio</a>
  </div>

</body>
</html>